  "extract": "Benjamin Allen \"Ben\" H. Winters is an American author. He is best known for mystery/sci-fi novels such as The Last Policeman and Underground Airlines, and for creating the CBS show Tracker.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Benjamin Allen \"Ben\" H. Winters</b> is an American author. He is best known for mystery/sci-fi novels such as <i>The Last Policeman</i> and <i>Underground Airlines</i>, and for creating the CBS show <i>Tracker</i>.</p>"
